# ========================================
# ===== USERS Http =====
# ========================================
# ----- 先执行 02-session.http 登录 -----

### 获取用户基础资料
GET {{addr}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 批量解析 UID/GID → 名字
# ----- 约束：去重后 uids+gids ≤ 5000；去重前每个数组 ≤ 8192；缺省/null 等价空数组 -----
# ----- 响应含 users/groups/notFound/ttl/negativeTtl；notFound 仅表示已确认不存在（故障时返回 503） -----
POST {{addr}}/api/users/id-mappings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "uids": [1000, 10001, 10002],
  "gids": [998, 9000]
}

### 批量解析 UID/GID → 名字（空请求：users/groups 为 {}，notFound 为 []）
POST {{addr}}/api/users/id-mappings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "uids": null,
  "gids": []
}


### 修改密码
PATCH {{addr}}/api/users/me/password
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "oldPassword": "{{password}}",
  "password": "new_password"
}
